<title>USA: Burke Cty, N.C. recalculated TIC.</title>
<headline>Burke Cty, N.C. recalculated TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burke County Officials said Wednesday that it recalculated Wachovia Bank of North Carolina's winning bid on the County's $18.765 million refunding general obligation bond issue, which sold Tuesday Dec. 3. The County said the true interest cost was 4.7412, not 4.7669 originally calculated.</p>
